        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the adult 2D anime woman identified by <Picture 1>, preserving her face, dark hair, bun hairstyle, bangs and gray-violet eyes. Her upper-body proportions follow the designated three-view reference.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] <Subject 1> demonstrates a simple outfit in a clean studio, slowly turning from a front view into a clear side view so that her upper-body silhouette can be compared across viewing angles.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (throughout [Shot 1]): partially_preserved - retain the facial identity and hairstyle from <Picture 1>; use the designated three-view reference for bust size, chest projection and upper-body proportions. Replace the original outfit and background with the studio outfit and setting described below.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] A single continuous 2D anime shot with crisp hand-drawn outlines, flat cel shading and soft even studio lighting. A plain pale blue background provides a clean contrast with her silhouette. The adult woman wears an opaque, fitted ivory short-sleeve fine-ribbed knit top with a modest crew neckline and a high-waisted dark skirt. The knit follows her torso without loose folds obscuring its shape. The camera is locked on a tripod at torso height, framing her entire head through her hips at a constant distance; no cuts, zoom or camera movement. Her arms remain relaxed and slightly away from her torso, keeping the front and side outlines visible. During the first second she stands upright facing the camera with relaxed shoulders. From one to four seconds she slowly rotates her whole body through a three-quarter view into a clear side profile, keeping the same upright posture. During the final second she holds the side view and gently turns only her eyes and head toward the camera with a small smile. Preserve the bust size and upper-body proportions specified by the three-view reference throughout this turn; the changing silhouette comes only from the viewing angle. Maintain a single character, stable anatomy, consistent clothing and smooth restrained motion.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet indoor room tone and faint clothing rustle. No speech.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.\n",
